// Survival crafting happens at a working station you stand at.
// * Workbench: always works. The pickaxe (tier 1) is made here, and then the pick digs limestone.
// * Forge: needs heat. Cold, it refuses; lava run into a pit beside it (within 3 m) lights it.
// * Workshop: needs power. Unpowered, it refuses; a thrown lever on copperline into it powers it, and the
//   drill (tier 2: bronze, alloyed at the forge from copper and tin) is made here.
// (bedrock roof: a 70-tile room would cave in otherwise)
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#......................................................................#
#.............................@........................................#
##############...#######################################################
########################################################################
end
mode survival
give Wood 20
give Stone 30
give Clay 8
give CopperOre 8
give TinOre 4
give CopperWire 16
mode survival
craft 3 Pickaxe
expect 4 inv:Pickaxe == 1             // the kit's pickaxe only: no workbench yet
station 5 2 0 Workbench
expect 6 buildings == 1
expect 6 inv:Wood == 16                // 20 (give sets the count), less the bench's 4
craft 7 Pickaxe
expect 8 inv:Pickaxe == 2
expect 8 tier == 1
// the forge: cold (no coal in the pack, no lava), then lava in the pit beside it
station 10 -12 0 Forge
craft 12 Copper_ingot
expect 13 inv:CopperIngot == 0
pour 14 -16 1 Lava
pour 14 -15 1 Lava
pour 14 -14 1 Lava
craft 16 Copper_ingot
craft 17 Copper_ingot
craft 18 Copper_ingot
craft 19 Tin_ingot
craft 20 Bronze_x4
expect 21 inv:CopperIngot == 0
expect 21 inv:TinIngot == 0
expect 21 inv:BronzeIngot == 4        // 3 copper + 1 tin ingot
// the workshop, over to the right
hold 22-60 right
station 62 14 0 Workshop
expect 63 buildings == 3
craft 64 Drill
expect 65 inv:Drill == 0               // no power yet
device 66 26 -1 Lever
wire 67 22 -1 26 -1
use 70 26 -1
craft 74 Drill
expect 75 inv:Drill == 1
expect 75 tier == 2
